# Security headers for the Palladin web panel (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify `_headers` format).
#
# This file is served from `public/` verbatim (Vite copies it into `dist/`) and
# is consumed by the static host to attach HTTP response headers. It is the
# single source of truth for the Content-Security-Policy.
#
# ⚠️  KEEP IN SYNC: whenever the app starts talking to a NEW external origin
#     (a new analytics host, OAuth provider, CDN, WebSocket endpoint, font
#     source, image host, …) the corresponding CSP directive below MUST be
#     updated in the same PR, or the browser will silently block the request.
#     The allow-list below is intentionally tight — see docs/architecture/security.md.
#
# Origins the app actually uses:
#   • script-src   self  + accounts.google.com (Google Identity)  + *.gstatic.com (Firebase compat SW scripts)
#   • connect-src  self  + API hosts (staging/prod)  + *.posthog.com  + *.googleapis.com (FCM)  + www.gstatic.com (SRI fetch)  + accounts.google.com  + wss://api(.stage).palladin.io (SignalR)
#
# NOTE: if a PostHog feature (session replay, surveys, exception autocapture) is
#       ever enabled from the PostHog UI, its lazily-injected script from
#       *.posthog.com must be added to script-src or the browser will block it.
#   • frame-src    accounts.google.com (Google sign-in popup/iframe)
#   • style/font   Google Fonts (fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com)
#   • img-src      self + data: + blob: (local icon preview) + https: (S3 icons, avatars)

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com https://*.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.palladin.io https://api.stage.palladin.io https://accounts.google.com https://*.posthog.com https://*.googleapis.com https://www.gstatic.com wss://api.palladin.io wss://api.stage.palladin.io; frame-src https://accounts.google.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
